{"title": "Actors Shah Rukh Khan, Ajay Devgn, Tiger Shroff Receive FDA Notices for Vimal Ad", "summary": "Maharashtra's Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has issued showcause notices to actors Shah Rukh Khan, Ajay Devgn, and Tiger Shroff concerning an advertisement for Vimal elaichi (cardamom). The notices were reportedly issued under the leadership of FDA commissioner Tukaram Mundhe. The specific reason for the notices relates to the Vimal elaichi advertisement.", "summary_points": ["Actors Shah Rukh Khan, Ajay Devgn, and Tiger Shroff received showcause notices from the FDA.", "The notices are related to an advertisement for Vimal elaichi (cardamom).", "The Maharashtra Food and Drug Administration (FDA) issued the notices.", "Tukaram Mundhe, the FDA commissioner, was reportedly leading the action."], "title_hi": "शाहरुख खान, अजय देवगन, टाइगर श्रॉफ को विमल पान मसाला विज्ञापन पर FDA का नोटिस", "summary_hi": "महाराष्ट्र के खाद्य एवं औषधि प्रशासन (FDA) ने विमल इलायची के विज्ञापन को लेकर अभिनेता शाहरुख खान, अजय देवगन और टाइगर श्रॉफ को कारण बताओ नोटिस जारी किया है। यह कार्रवाई कथित तौर पर FDA आयुक्त तुकाराम मुंढे के नेतृत्व में हुई। नोटिस जारी होने का विशिष्ट कारण विमल इलायची का विज्ञापन है।", "summary_points_hi": ["अभिनेता शाहरुख खान, अजय देवगन और टाइगर श्रॉफ को FDA से कारण बताओ नोटिस मिला है।", "ये नोटिस विमल इलायची (इलायची) के विज्ञापन से संबंधित हैं।", "महाराष्ट्र खाद्य एवं औषधि प्रशासन (FDA) ने नोटिस जारी किए।", "FDA आयुक्त तुकाराम मुंढे कथित तौर पर इस कार्रवाई का नेतृत्व कर रहे थे।"], "framing": {"center": ["Reported the issuance of showcause notices by the FDA to the three actors.", "Mentioned the specific product, Vimal elaichi (cardamom).", "Included the names of the actors: Shah Rukh Khan, Ajay Devgn, and Tiger Shroff.", "Noted that Tukaram Mundhe-led FDA issued the notices."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["तीन अभिनेताओं को FDA द्वारा कारण बताओ नोटिस जारी करने की सूचना दी।", "विशिष्ट उत्पाद, विमल इलायची (इलायची) का उल्लेख किया।", "अभिनेताओं के नाम शामिल किए: शाहरुख खान, अजय देवगन और टाइगर श्रॉफ।", "बताया कि तुकाराम मुंढे के नेतृत्व वाले FDA ने नोटिस जारी किए।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://images.bhaskarassets.com/thumb/730x0/web2images/521/2026/08/16/___________________________________-_2026-08-16t20_1786891064881.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Gulf News", "owner": "Gulf News", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Pan masala ad row: Shah Rukh Khan, Ajay Devgn, Tiger Shroff face FDA notices"}, {"source": "Hindustan Times", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/bollywood/sunny-deol-says-he-will-never-do-pan-masala-ads-amid-fda-notices-to-shah-rukh-khan-ajay-devgn-101786879586718.html", "headline": "Sunny Deol says he will never do pan masala ads amid FDA notices to Shah Rukh Khan , Ajay Devgn : Mera zameer nahi manta"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "owner": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Shah Rukh Khan, Ajay Devgn, Tiger Shroff get FDA showcause notices over Vimal elaichi ad"}, {"source": "Deccan Chronicle", "owner": "Deccan Chronicle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Shah Rukh, Ajay, Tiger Face FDA Notices Over Vimal Pan Masala Ad"}, {"source": "The Free Press Journal", "owner": "The Free Press Journal", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "FDA Issues Notices To Shah Rukh Khan, Ajay Devgn, Tiger Shroff Over Vimal Elaichi Ad"}, {"source": "The Free Press Journal", "owner": "The Free Press Journal", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Maharashtra: Tukaram Mundhe-Led FDA Cracks Down On Vimal Ad, Issues Notices To SRK, Ajay Devgn & Tiger Shroff"}, {"source": "Outlook India", "owner": "Outlook India", "lean": "center", "language"